    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Spirit Hunter",
      "actions": 1,
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "The duskwalker designates a single creature they can observe as their prey.\n\nThe duskwalker gains a +2 circumstance bonus to Deception checks, Intimidation checks, and Stealth checks against their prey and to any check to Recall Knowledge about it, and deal an additional 2 spirit damage with all weapon Strikes against their prey.\n\nThese effects last until the duskwalker uses Spirit Hunter again.",
